<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Baba Yogiraj Club Chiyanki</title><style>body{margin:0;font-family:Arial;background:#fff8e1}.top{background:#7a0a2a;color:#ffeb3b;padding:15px;text-align:center}.banner{background:#ffcc00;padding:20px;text-align:center;border:5px solid #7a0a2a}.pres{background:#7a0a2a;color:#ffeb3b;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:8px;display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;font-weight:bold;font-size:18px}.cards{padding:15px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:15px}.card{background:white;border:2px solid #7a0a2a;border-radius:10px;padding:15px;flex:1;min-width:250px}.footer{background:#7a0a2a;color:white;text-align:center;padding:10px}</style></head><body><div class="top"><h1>BABA YOGIRAJ CLUB CHIYANKI</h1><p>ESTD 2022 | Pahadi Tola, Chiyanki</p></div><div class="banner"><h2>श्री श्री सरस्वती पूजा महोत्सव</h2><p>बाबा योगी राज क्लब चियांकी, पहाड़ी टोला आपका हार्दिक अभिनन्दन करता है</p><div class="pres">President: Navin Kumar Singh</div></div><div class="cards"><div class="card"><h3>Welcome</h3><p>Baba Yogiraj Club Chiyanki is a social and cultural club dedicated to preserving culture and spirituality.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>About Us</h3><p>Established in 2022 at Pahadi Tola, Chiyanki. We organize Saraswati Puja, cultural programs and community service.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Gallery</h3><p>Saraswati Puja 2024 Photos - Cultural Events - Bhajan Programs</p></div></div><div class="footer">Baba Yogiraj Club Chiyanki - Pahadi Tola, Chiyanki - Estd 2022</div></body></html>
